  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/LeperGnome/bt/zipball/v1.3.0",
  "body": "## Changes\r\nMost changes in this release are focused on preview configuration and behavior:\r\n- Tree takes **full width**, when preview is disabled. \r\n- Enabling/disabling the preview is now done via new configuration `preview_enabled` on startup (config file + cli) and new binding `L` to toggle dynamically.\r\n- You can now adjust the width of the preview section via new configuration - `preview_ratio` on startup (config file + cli) and new bindings `[`, `]` to shrink / grow dynamically.  (thx @pfr-dev) \r\n- Older `file_preview` config is removed.\r\n\r\nAlso new configuration added to control whether you want to show hidden files by default - `show_hidden`. You can still toggle show/hide hidden dynamically, but you have to do that for every directory. \r\n\r\n## Log\r\n* feat: new config - show hidden files by default by @LeperGnome in https://github.com/LeperGnome/bt/pull/36\r\n* feat: variable preview width by @pfr-dev in https://github.com/LeperGnome/bt/pull/32\r\n* feat: configure preview ratio by @LeperGnome in https://github.com/LeperGnome/bt/pull/37\r\n* feat: file preview toggle by @LeperGnome in https://github.com/LeperGnome/bt/pull/38\r\n* Added creation of install directory, if it's missing by @secnigma in https://github.com/LeperGnome/bt/pull/10\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\nBig thanks to people that participate in bt development, especially @pfr-dev \r\n\r\n* @pfr-dev made their first contribution in https://github.com/LeperGnome/bt/pull/32\r\n* @secnigma made their first contribution in https://github.com/LeperGnome/bt/pull/10\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/LeperGnome/bt/compare/v1.2.2...v1.3.0",
